{
    "title": "Pocket Toons",
    "description": "Welcome to a new era of entertainment that\u2019s refreshing, engaging, and entertaining. Welcome to Pocket Toons. \r\n\r\nDiscover a world of well-crafted, bite-sized stories in the form of webtoons across multiple genres. Fall in love all over again with stories about love, friendship, and heartbreak. Get lost into a mystery world of wizards, magicians, and superpowers. Get inspired by smash hit rags-to-riches stories\r\n\r\nOur wide collection of stories has something for everyone. Whether you are a connoisseur of comics or a hobbyist, you will find something perfect for your taste. Enjoy non-stop entertainment with hundreds of comics and binge-worthy stories.\r\n\r\nAnd that\u2019s not all. Our cutting-edge technology ensures that entertainment never stops. No more waiting for weekly drops. Get your favorite comics daily with Pocket Toons. \r\n\r\nWith our innovative micro-payments model, pay for only what you read. No more monthly or yearly subscriptions. No more paying for what you did not consume. \r\n\r\nWhat makes Pocket Toons a favorite worldwide:\r\n- New episodes daily. No more waiting for weekly drops.\r\n- Intuitive user interface for a seamless app experience\r\n- Read comics on the go, with a download feature\r\n- Pay for what you read. No subscription fees. \r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download Pocket Toons now and experience the new age of comics.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to a new era of entertainment that\u2019s refreshing, engaging, and entertaining. Welcome to Pocket Toons. <br><br>Discover a world of well-crafted, bite-sized stories in the form of webtoons across multiple genres. Fall in love all over again with stories about love, friendship, and heartbreak. Get lost into a mystery world of wizards, magicians, and superpowers. Get inspired by smash hit rags-to-riches stories<br><br>Our wide collection of stories has something for everyone. Whether you are a connoisseur of comics or a hobbyist, you will find something perfect for your taste. Enjoy non-stop entertainment with hundreds of comics and binge-worthy stories.<br><br>And that\u2019s not all. Our cutting-edge technology ensures that entertainment never stops. No more waiting for weekly drops. Get your favorite comics daily with Pocket Toons. <br><br>With our innovative micro-payments model, pay for only what you read. No more monthly or yearly subscriptions. No more paying for what you did not consume. <br><br>What makes Pocket Toons a favorite worldwide:<br>- New episodes daily. No more waiting for weekly drops.<br>- Intuitive user interface for a seamless app experience<br>- Read comics on the go, with a download feature<br>- Pay for what you read. No subscription fees. <br><br>What are you waiting for? Download Pocket Toons now and experience the new age of comics.",
